I had to download the data for a subset of bots at a single site (Lomond #2) as there was no cell service at that site. One of those bots was able to connect and transmit data, so I'll check what I generate with the SD card data against what it transmitted to be sure everything is there and the timestamps align. I will also need to consult my field notes to figure out the best way to adjust timestamps for each bot after it went offline (e.g. some seemed to be in EST, some in NL time).

